      "text": "Waking up early (pre 6am) &amp; starting the day with a walk has been one of the best hacks to increase my quality of thought\n\nThere’s research that shows activating your visual cortex w/a walk turns on your brain, &amp; my thoughts in the morning are clearer, calmer, and more deliberate",
