      "text": "The real web3:\n\nIt’s pretty clear that the true next internet paradigm is the AI-powered web.\n\nWeb 1—read\nWeb 2—read &amp; write\nWeb 3—read &amp; write &amp; computer read &amp; computer write \n\nBecause of the baggage with the term web3, I’m proposing we call this new shift web4.\n\nWho’s with me?",
