      "text": "One of the saddest societal norms is losing curiosity at age 22.\n\nWe are encouraged to in explore through the end of college, but then fiercely pivot towards exploitation—“go get a career!”\n\nPeople intellectually complexity until 22, but then we simplify.\n\nIt’s a tragedy.",
