      "text": "We’re entering a new era\n\n1980s: Mass Media (MM)📺\n2000s: User-Generated Content (UGC)📱\n2020s: AI Generated Content (AIGC)🤖\n\nMM—&gt;UGC was an explosion in content &amp; virality emerged\n\nUGC—&gt;AIGC will be a similar explosion &amp; *individualization* to audiences of one will emerge",
