      },
      "text": "Loneliness is an epidemic. It’s on the rise, and a real public health problem.\n\nThis technology, when it exists, has the potential for a lot of good.\n\nhttps://t.co/mYZCPH954h",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1577309210203033602"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "conversation_id": "1577301251783811083",
      "created_at": "2022-10-04T14:14:57.000Z",
      "display_text_range": [
        0,
        279
      ],
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1577301251783811083"
      ],
      "id": "1577301251783811083",
      "lang": "en",
      "possibly_sensitive": false,
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 90,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 751,
        "quote_count": 102,
        "reply_count": 121,
        "retweet_count": 113
      },
      "text": "We are at a critical turning point for humanity:\n\nChildren born today are likely to have more AI friends than human friends\n\nAI friends are going to be more reliable, conciliatory, and considerate\n\nWhat does this means for childhood development and social norms? We will find out",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1577301251783811083"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "conversation_id": "1576815967371292672",
      "created_at": "2022-10-04T14:09:15.000Z",
      "display_text_range": [
        7,
        287
      ],
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1577299816392306689"
      ],
      "entities": {
