      ],
      "text": "@gwern Fashion is a specific edge case, not the norm from an IP perspective.\n\nMickey Mouse is owned &amp; enforceable IP, and I’ll pay to have Mickey Mouse in legal content I want to produce.\n\nI also think 0-marginal-cost content generation is weird &amp; unprecedented, so analogies don’t hold.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1577174196404162560"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "conversation_id": "1576950188828073984",
      "created_at": "2022-10-03T14:59:57.000Z",
      "display_text_range": [
