      "id": "1576950188828073984",
      "lang": "en",
      "possibly_sensitive": false,
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 19,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 150,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 10,
        "retweet_count": 21
      },
      "text": "A few invariants:\n\n- Humanity will always invent more, not less\n\n- Machines will always become more powerful, never less\n\n- Humanity will always explore more, not less [these days, we explore space]\n\n- Humanity will become more densely networked, not less",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1576950188828073984"
    },
