      "text": "Feels dirty when an artist’s name is in a prompt (which is unfortunately nearly all of https://t.co/X2sDl5OHwu).\n\nYou are explicitly asking the AI to imitate an artist’s unique style 🤧\n\nWe need to give artists royalties on images created using prompts w/their names ASAP!",
