        "text": "@alexandr_wang To be clear, the point of this was to say “that’s wild” not “that makes no sense”. Snowflake has built an excellent product that drives an enormous amount of value — it’s why they also have the highest $ / customer of recent infra IPOs.  It just surprised me when I did the math."
