          "quote_count": 4,
          "reply_count": 9,
          "retweet_count": 3
        },
        "text": "As of Q2, Snowflake had ~6,800 customers.\n\nAt the of time of this tweet, Snowflake's market cap is ~$50B.\n\nThat comes out to $7.35M of market cap PER CUSTOMER. \n\n🍌s"
